# CQ-M1: Which characteristic marks does each theory treat as essential?
PREFIX odsr: <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?theory (GROUP_CONCAT(?mark; separator="; ") AS ?marks)
WHERE {
  ?t odsr:identifiesDesireWith ?m .
  ?t rdfs:label ?theory . ?m rdfs:label ?mark .
}
GROUP BY ?theory ORDER BY ?theory
